{"2414450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prophecy Island", "steam_appid": 2414450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophecy Island is an open world roguelite rpg. The 7 mightiest factions fight to fulfil an ancient prophecy by ridding the island of a long spreading curse and taking control over it. Fail to do so, and you will find yourself on a new island to try all over again. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomly remixed adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/571c14cb90709e58b1c8a3bd58ddfb13.avif?t=1785832701\" width=400 height=130 /></span><br><br>The main story line is remixed every playthrough, delivering a compelling story to play through with twists to the story to keep it fresh. Alongside this main quest-line are also generated side-quest lines that help create more unique adventures every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total of 7 factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/df6d2dd5895eed0128e1cfd244cfc679.poster.avif?t=1785832701\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/df6d2dd5895eed0128e1cfd244cfc679.webm?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/df6d2dd5895eed0128e1cfd244cfc679.mp4?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start out with 2 standard classes to begin your adventure with. During your adventures on the island you will unlock the other factions to bring even more replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RogueLite elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/c54c610d76f124e15889d15f9474dbb0.poster.avif?t=1785832701\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/c54c610d76f124e15889d15f9474dbb0.webm?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/c54c610d76f124e15889d15f9474dbb0.mp4?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you died too many times New Game + is automaticly triggered. This means your character and the entire island die permenantly. A new island will be created based on your actions from the previous island. You will also be allowed to bring with you special loot you unlocked during your previous adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/3b7226fa54e74fe05cac15b017d85106.poster.avif?t=1785832701\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/3b7226fa54e74fe05cac15b017d85106.webm?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/3b7226fa54e74fe05cac15b017d85106.mp4?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sigils allow the player to attach special effects to their weapons, or to create custom spells for their staffs. By allowing up to 3 sigils at once on any weapon or spell, the player has a lot a options </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophecy Island is an open world roguelite rpg. The 7 mightiest factions fight to fulfil an ancient prophecy by ridding the island of a long spreading curse and taking control over it. Fail to do so, and you will find yourself on a new island to try all over again. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomly remixed adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/571c14cb90709e58b1c8a3bd58ddfb13.avif?t=1785832701\" width=400 height=130 /></span><br><br>The main story line is remixed every playthrough, delivering a compelling story to play through with twists to the story to keep it fresh. Alongside this main quest-line are also generated side-quest lines that help create more unique adventures every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total of 7 factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/df6d2dd5895eed0128e1cfd244cfc679.poster.avif?t=1785832701\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/df6d2dd5895eed0128e1cfd244cfc679.webm?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/df6d2dd5895eed0128e1cfd244cfc679.mp4?t=1785832701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start out with 2 standard classes to begin your adventure with. During your adventures on the island you will unlock the other factions to bring even more replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RogueLite elements</h2><